      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Keep queued pauses authoritative over stale day controls**\n\nWhen another tab has queued or acknowledged a pause while this tab still displays a completed day, `DayStatusCard` can append an `OPEN` transition, and this fold replaces the preceding `PAUSED` state with `OPEN`. Because day-status mutations are not validated against pause state, a subsequent Add Food submission sees the day as open; replay then stores the open day and creates the food while the global pause remains active (the backend's `getEffectiveFoodDay` prioritizes stored days over covering pauses). Reject stale day transitions while paused, or require a durable resume before allowing a day control to reopen the date.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
